  "bounds": "179 managed cases/groups passed using injected native results, clock and network plus isolated recovery processes. Native C++/D3D11 WARP ran 26 top-level checks: ten encoding/cache checks, one aggregate of twenty existing controls, and fifteen masked-image checks. These generated fixtures do not capture protected video or establish physical lighting acceptance. Previous owner-confirmed lock/off/resume and automatic display-off/resume remain historical evidence. No full system-sleep or long-duration physical acceptance for this build.",
